<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ējecto</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. freq. a.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to cast out</i>, <i>to throw up</i> (a <b>poet.</b> word of the Aug. per.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arenas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					5, 353</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">favillam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 2, 231</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undas in campos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					10, 320</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quicquid ab auriferis fossis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 3, 3, 89</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cruentas dapes ore,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to vomit</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 14, 211</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saniem per ora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					3, 658</span></i>
			.</div>
